    {
      "id": 239660,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2021-07-29T13:23:36.844Z",
      "cooked": "<details>\n<summary>\nSummary</summary>\n<p>Marxman Biography unredacted from pdf of SCRPG core rulebook</p>\n<p>Pavel was in Stalingrad at age 17 when the Nazis invaded. The ammunition factory where his parents worked was an early target, and after their death he joined the Red Army Unit 23. After the surrender of the Axis forces in Stalingrad, he was deployed all along the Eastern Front including Kursk, Finland, and Warsaw to destabilize axis operations in advance of Soviet<br>\nforces. He was then recruited for the NKVD’s covert kill squad to eliminate political dissidents, disrupt CIA and MI6 agents, and assassinate foreign scientists studying space travel. In 1950, the NKVD established a sleeper program by order of Joseph Stalin. He was embedded in La Paz, Bolivia, ordered to maintain readiness until activated.<br>\nActivations:<br>\nApr. 15, 1951: Nuclear test team 5 | Nuclear testing<br>\nsite 5, Nevada<br>\nJune 26, 1951: Korean theater command | The<br>\nPentagon, Arlington, VA<br>\nMar. 18, 1952: CIA Chief and Assistant | CIA HQ<br>\nLangley, VA<br>\nNov. 22, 1963: John F. Kennedy | Dallas, TX<br>\nJun 23, 1967: Lyndon Baines Johnson | Glassboro NJ |<br>\nMISSION ABORT, authorization A. Kosygin</p>\n</details>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-07-29T13:34:11.362Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 32,
      "readers_count": 31,
      "score": 86.4,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 28707,
      "topic_slug": "spoilers-who-killed-jfk-in-the-sentinels-canon",
      "display_username": "Sonvar",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 2,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "\n[details=\"Summary\"]\nMarxman Biography unredacted from pdf of SCRPG core rulebook\n\nPavel was in Stalingrad at age 17 when the Nazis invaded. The ammunition factory where his parents worked was an early target, and after their death he joined the Red Army Unit 23. After the surrender of the Axis forces in Stalingrad, he was deployed all along the Eastern Front including Kursk, Finland, and Warsaw to destabilize axis operations in advance of Soviet \nforces. He was then recruited for the NKVD’s covert kill squad to eliminate political dissidents, disrupt CIA and MI6 agents, and assassinate foreign scientists studying space travel. In 1950, the NKVD established a sleeper program by order of Joseph Stalin. He was embedded in La Paz, Bolivia, ordered to maintain readiness until activated.\nActivations:\nApr. 15, 1951: Nuclear test team 5 | Nuclear testing \nsite 5, Nevada\nJune 26, 1951: Korean theater command | The \nPentagon, Arlington, VA\nMar. 18, 1952: CIA Chief and Assistant | CIA HQ \nLangley, VA\nNov. 22, 1963: John F. Kennedy | Dallas, TX\nJun 23, 1967: Lyndon Baines Johnson | Glassboro NJ | \nMISSION ABORT, authorization A. Kosygin\n[/details]",
